WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:05.872
Open Shopping from Home. Add the things you need to buy. Before adding another entry,

00:05.872 --> 00:11.280
check existing items and filters so that something already listed is not duplicated.

00:15.400 --> 00:21.104
Enter the name. Add an amount, unit, store or buyer when useful. Choose when it is

00:21.104 --> 00:25.417
needed if you want to plan ahead. Review the entry, then save.

00:30.400 --> 00:35.929
When you buy an item, tap its purchase circle and review what happens next. You can

00:35.929 --> 00:41.058
update pantry inventory, use a separate pack, or finish without adding stock.

00:45.400 --> 00:50.469
If you scan the receipt after recording a purchase, review recent matches and link

00:50.469 --> 00:55.475
the existing purchase when offered. This avoids stocking the same purchase twice.

00:55.475 --> 00:57.762
Check the final review before saving.
